00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:14,000
Lucky Luke is a comedy, western film directed by Terence Hill.

2
00:12:16,000 --> 00:12:22,000
Lucky Luke becomes the Sheriff of Daisy Town and runs out all the criminals.

3
00:18:24,000 --> 00:18:30,000
Then the Dalton brothers arrive and try to get the Indians to
break the peace treaty and attack the town.

4
00:24:32,000 --> 00:24:38,000
Lucky Luke, played by Terence Hill.

5
00:30:40,000 --> 00:30:46,000
Lotta Legs, played by Nancy Morgan.

6
00:36:48,000 --> 00:36:54,000
Jolly Jumper, played by Roger Miller.

7
