10
01:01:20,000 --> 01:01:26,000
Lucky Luke is a 1991 Italian-American Western comedy film directed by and starring
Terence Hill and based on the Belgian comic book of the same name.

11
01:07:28,000 --> 01:07:34,000
It is also the pilot episode of the Lucky Luke television series.

12
01:13:36,000 --> 01:13:42,000
It was shot in Bonanza Creek Ranch and Santa Fe (New Mexico), Zia Pueblo, Valles Caldera National
Preserve, White Sands National Monument and La Junta (Colorado), and Tucson, Arizona.

13
01:19:44,000 --> 01:19:50,000
The film explores themes of saloon, brother, horse, arrest, spaghetti western.

14
01:25:52,000 --> 01:25:58,000
The tone is lighthearted.
